# nohello.poke -- an op before the handshake is fatal.
#
# ABI.md section 3.1: any op other than hello as the first frame answers
# NOHELLO and the broker exits. Fatal rather than recoverable because a
# program that has not agreed a version has not agreed what its own bytes
# mean, and carrying on would be guessing.
#
#   exit  op 02, len 1, code 0 -- valid in itself, and refused here anyway
EMIT 02 01 00 00
READ 3
